{"Inconsistent findByName overloads (with/without ownerId) can yield null even when resources exist, causing subtle lookup failures across permission evaluation paths": 0.3709476888179779, "V1 uses resource type 'Client' with name prefix 'client.resource.', while V2 uses 'Clients' as both type and name, preventing V2 from finding V1-created resources": 0.1755402833223343, "ClientPermissionsV2 overrides many methods (setPermissionsEnabled, exchangeToPermission, mapRolesPermission, etc.) with unconditional UnsupportedOperationException throws, yet production code (AdminPermissions.registerListener) and tests invoke these methods when V2 is active, causing runtime failures": 0.7913849949836731}